          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: CONDAMINE-CHATELARD (LA) (04) 29.06.1993 T1 CONDAMINE-CHATELARD (LA) (04) 29.06.1993 T2",
          "text_sha256": "6d97e05e524eb510dfa9bb1596ae881c26bcde5ebde2e7ebd59b354fa028083e"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
